From: Taniya Das <taniya.das@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Sat, 8 Aug 2026 17:20:41 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] dt-bindings: clock: qcom: Add gcc debug mux support on
 QCS8300

Add gcc debug mux bindings to measure the clock frequencies on the
Qualcomm QCS8300 platform.

Signed-off-by: Taniya Das <taniya.das@oss.qualcomm.com>
---
 include/dt-bindings/clock/qcom,qcs8300-gcc.h | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/include/dt-bindings/clock/qcom,qcs8300-gcc.h b/include/dt-bindings/clock/qcom,qcs8300-gcc.h
index a0083b1d2126..dfe565c78ab4 100644
--- a/include/dt-bindings/clock/qcom,qcs8300-gcc.h
+++ b/include/dt-bindings/clock/qcom,qcs8300-gcc.h
@@ -191,6 +191,7 @@
 #define GCC_VIDEO_AXI0_CLK					181
 #define GCC_VIDEO_AXI1_CLK					182
 #define GCC_VIDEO_XO_CLK					183
+#define GCC_DEBUG_MUX						184
 
 /* GCC power domains */
 #define GCC_EMAC0_GDSC						0
